<title>UK: Smith &amp; Nephew trading in line with trends.</title>
<headline>Smith &amp; Nephew trading in line with trends.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Healthcare group Smith &amp; Nephew Plc said on Friday that its trading performance overall was &quot;broadly as expected in line with previous trends&quot; in a statement released after a briefing with UK brokers.</p>
<p>The statement added, however, that currencies continued to take their toll as a result of continued sterling and dollar strength since the year end.</p>
<p>--London newsroom +44 171 5427717.</p>
</text>
